{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19992","headline":"寒溪 五 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一曲一直水，白龙何鳞鳞。\n冻飙杂碎号，韲音坑谷辛。\n柧椾吃无力，飞走更相仁。\n猛弓一折弦，余喘争来宾。\n大严此之立，小杀不复陈。\n皎皎何皎皎，氤氲复氤氲。\n瑞晴刷日月，高碧开星辰。\n独立两脚雪，孤吟千虑新。\n天欃徒昭昭，箕舌虚齗齗。\n尧圣不听汝，孔微亦有臣。\n谏书竟成章，古义终难陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}